Responsibilities:
• Development and maintenance of Test automation tool and test support tool with knowledge of CANoe and Python;
• Perform RTM deep dive function validation and debugging;
• Support on function development of RTM software and hardware;
• Support on functional requirements clarification of RTM software and hardware, with respective stakeholders;
• Coordinate with national/local standard governing institutions to conduct RTM functional certification testing;
• Support the writing of test cases and verification of functional tests of tester;
• Prepare briefing documents for project status;
Qualifications:
• Strong understanding of automotive grade hardware knowledge;
• Proficiency with RTM GB/T32960, telematics service and control units development; • Good experience on RTM certification process;
• Strong understanding of car bus system and protocol, like CAN bus;
• Strong understanding of Python and CAPL;
• Strong understanding of diagnose and experience with diagnoses tools;
• Good understanding of network architecture, network protocol, AutoSAR and so on;
Other to highlight：
• Outgoing and actively communicable;
• Open minded and willing to learn new knowledge on job;
• Fast thinking and demonstrated experience of summarization;
• Good planning skills and well-organized;
• Ability to work under pressure and multitasking
